{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式で出てますが\n全国握手会のライブは\n怪我（捻挫）のため欠席致します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"捻挫のせいで今日まで色々なお仕事を欠席せざるおえなかったのが\n凄くつらいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで学業とか\n家族の用事とか\n何もかも置いて\n1番を乃木坂46にしてたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欠席です\nって言葉が凄く重いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからといっても\nどうすればいいのか\nどうしようもない事なのですが\nとても、もどかしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今の期間を無駄にする事なく\n今までずっと出ていたものを1回外から客観的にとらえられるチャンスとして\n考えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本当にこの期間は\n物の価値観とかを変えれる期間にしたいと思っています。\nいい意味で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、握手会はあります！\n楽しみましょう！\nみんな同じ空間にいます！\nそう考えたら気持ちがましになる！\n発表されてからすぐ\n皆さんがくれたコメントを読んで元気貰いました！\nテラダ頑張るぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走りたい( ´-`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/04/15/9312627/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛びたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/04/15/9312627/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着地"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/04/15/9312627/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほい( ´-`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/04/15/9312627/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/04/15/9312627/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の地震心配です。\n特に九州地方の方\n私もおじいちゃんが九州地方なので\n電話しました、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余震も多いと思いますが\n引き続きお気をつけてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寺田蘭世"}],"source":"archive"}